<!--
  SYNTHETIC SAMPLE — NO REAL TAXPAYER DATA. The tourist is an invented person
  with a placeholder passport number; the intermediary is a fake institution.

  BRANCH PROVED: TRAVELLER GOODS / TAX-FREE (YOLCUBERABERFATURA / ISTISNA).
  The export sample and this one both fill cac:BuyerCustomerParty, but the model
  branches on the PROFILE: with YOLCUBERABERFATURA the second party block is
  rendered as a TOURIST (passport + nationality), not as a foreign company.
  Only this sample reaches:

    · taxfree.touristName       — cac:BuyerCustomerParty/cac:Party/cac:Person
    · taxfree.passportNumber    — cac:Person/cac:IdentityDocumentReference/cbc:ID
    · taxfree.intermediaryTaxId — cac:TaxRepresentativeParty with
                                  schemeID='ARACIKURUMVKN' (the institution that
                                  pays the VAT refund back to the tourist)

  cac:Person carries cbc:NationalityID as an ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 CODE on purpose:
  it proves the country dictionary is reached from the tax-free identity block.
-->
